<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle no test - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle no test - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said there were not enough slaughter steers or heifers to test the trade.</p>
